&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nota:&lt;/strong&gt; ✋ This post was originally published on my blog &lt;a href="https://wiki-cloud.co/en/2026/07/google-adk-intro-ai-agent-development/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;wiki-cloud.co&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
